
Binary files for flashing the PiPico With RomWBW

Note If you have a ROmWBW with an LED you need to use the -LED version. 

I will not be providing binary images for ROmWBW for the RP2040 from July 2026, the last version is here. 
You can however compile them from sources, but you do need to turn off many of the extra features that are available of the 2350 version. 
